IMPORT prelude

-- Civil Liability Act 2003 (Queensland) -- whether the Act reaches the claim (ss 4, 5, 7(1)), and the dictionary
-- terms the other modules share (schedule 2: dust-related condition, harm, personal injury damages).
--
-- SEAT: the person who suffered harm and claims damages for it (the injured person, or for a death the dependants or
-- the estate). See NOTES.md.
--
